# CounterStrikeSharp.API's build targets copy every project's compiled output
# into <project>/build/addons/counterstrikesharp/plugins/<name>/ on every local
# `dotnet build`. That folder is a build artifact, not source - never commit it,
# or people who download the repo end up deploying stale DLLs instead of a
# fresh build. (See VIPCore/modules/*/build/ - previously committed by mistake.)
